# Writer prompt template

One `delegate_task` per draft. Three drafts per beat, each a separate agent.

**Never substitute a duration or total word count into this template.** The writer sees
one beat's cap and nothing else about length. If "5 minutes" or "750 words" appears
anywhere in the prompt, the padding behaviour returns immediately.

